{
  "id": "JDG.8",
  "number": "8",
  "bookId": "JDG",
  "reference": "Abayaasii 8",
  "verseCount": 35,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo abaEfuraimu nibamureeba bari Obeele orie nineefu, norakhulanga olwa orulile okhuseera Midiani ta? Nibamuloshela butinyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye nabakalusia mbu Aka ekholile bulaano kachelasibwe nakeenywe noho? Okhuruluma khwetsinzabibu khwaEfuraimu shikhushila lichesa liaAbiezeri? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyasaye ahaanile abakhulundu baMidiani, Orebu naZeebu, mumukhono kweenywe; aka enyalile okhukhola isie kachelasibwe nakeenywe? Kho nibakwa omuuya, olwa yaboola ario.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gideoni yehamba abaruchi baMidiani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mane Gideoni niyoola enaYorodani, niyaambukha, ye nabandu abo ebikhumi bitaru aba yali ninabo, nibachoonyile, ne nibashilondachila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nasaba abaSukotsi ari Chama muheelesie abandu abanondakhwo emikaate; shichila baluyile, ne enondachila Zeba naZalumuna, abaruchi baMidiani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakhulundu baSukotsi nibamureeba mbu Ne Zeba naZalumuna bali mumukhonokwo bulaano, abakhachila khwaheelesia abelihelio emikaate? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Gideoni nasunga mbu Kho olwa OMWAMI alaba nahaanile Zeba naZalumuna mumukhono kwanje, ndalahuula inyama yemibili chieenywe nende amasaka kamahwa akomushitsiimi nebisisia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana narulayo natikulukha niyoola ePenueli, nasungana ninabo ario; abaPenueli nabo nibamukalusia amalala kario, shinga abaSukotsi olwa bali nibamukalusiye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naboolela abaPenueli bosi, ari Olwa ndalakalukha mumulembe, ndalalikulula omunaara kuno.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Zeba naZalumuna bali nibali eKarikori, halala namahe kabwe, abandu shinga ebikhumila ekhumi nabiraano, bosi abali nibasikaale khwihe liabandu bebukwe; okhuba abali nibeerwa bali abandu ebikhumila eshikhumi namakhumi kabili abetsinganga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Gideoni natikulukha nabirila khunjila yabo abamenya mumaheema, ebukwe weNoba naYogubeha, narootsa lihe elo; okhuba abelihe tsana bakaala mbu bali shisale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo Zeba naZalumuna nibeelukha; nabalondachilila, nahamba abaruchi abo babili baMidiani, Zeba naZalumuna, nakoyaasia lihe liosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Gideoni waYoashi yakalukha okhurula mwihe, nabirila khushisia shiaHeresi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne yahamba omusooliili undi wabandu baSukotsi, namureebelesiakhwo; naye namuhandiichila abakhulundu baSukotsi, nabakofu bayo, abandu amakhumi musaafu namusaafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niyoola mubaSukotsi, nabasunjila mbu Lole, Zeba naZalumuna mbabano, aba mwambalabalilakhwo muri Ne Zeba naZalumuna bali mumukhonokwo bulaano, abakhachila khwabaheelesia emikaate abelihelio abaluyile? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho nabukula abakofu tsana belitaala, namasaka kamahwa akomushitsiimi nebisisia, niyeechia abaSukotsi ninabio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi nalikulula omunaara kwaPenueli, niyeera abandu belitaala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana yareeba Zeba naZalumuna, ari Bali heena aba mweerela eTabori? Nabo nibakalusia mbu Shinga iwe olwa oli, nolwa bafwana bario; buli mulala yeengana omwana womuruchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye ari Mbula, bali abaana beefwe, abomweefwe; shinga OMWAMI olwa ali mwoyo, nimuba nimwakhabahonokosiye baba mwoyo, shindakhamwira ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana nasunjila Yetseri, omwanawe wambeli, ari Buukha, obeere. Nebutswa omusooliili oyo shiyatsomola olukangalwe ta, okhuba yaria, shichila yali nashili omusooliili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Zeba naZalumuna nibaboola mbu Iwe buukha, okhukwekhwo; shichila shinga omundu olwa ali, nindio amaanike kali. Naye Gideoni nabuukha, niyeera Zeba naZalumuna, nabukula ebimili ebiamela shinga omwesi omutoro ebiali mumakosi ketsingamia tsiabwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ebikhole bindi biaGideoni, nokhufwahhwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana abaIsiraeli nibasunjila Gideoni bari Okhuruchenje, iwe omwene, nomwanawo, nomwitsukhuluwo yesi; okhuba okhuhoniye mumukhono kwaMidiani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gideoni nabakalusia mbu Shindalamuruka, kata omwana wanje shialamuruka tawe; OMWAMI alamurukanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gideoni nabasunjila mbu Ndakheenya okhumusaba likhuwa; mbu mumbeesie buli mundu tsingaka etsiokhubiyaayobie. Okhuba bali natsingaka tsieitsahaabu, shichila bali abaIshimaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo nibakalusia mbu Khuchamile okhutsihaana. Nibaala ingubo, buli mundu nafuubakhwo tsingaka tsiebiyaayobie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nobusiro bwetsingaka tsieitsahaabu etsia yasaba bwali tsishekeli eshikhumila nebikhumi musaafu tsieitsahaabu; khandi nende ebimili ebiamela shinga omwesi omutoro, nebitaati, netsingubo tsieisambarau etsia abaruchi baMidiani bali nibeefwala, khandi nende obunyolo obwali mumakosi ketsingamia tsiabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Gideoni natsikhola efoti, nachira mwitaalalie, muOfira; abaIsiraeli bosi nibachilondakhwo shinga abaheyi; niyikwa omubero khuGideoni nabomunzuye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
