              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kata shibabeela eshisa abeinzu yaYerubaali, niye Gideoni, khulwa amalayi kosi aka yali niyakholela Isiraeli, tawe.",
          "type": "text",
